• 채널톡 링크드인 : https://www.linkedin.com/company/channelcorporation/', 'name_mismatch', false, '㈜헤브메이드스타일', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', NULL, NULL);
