- 유튜브 : https://www.youtube.com/@perigeespace', 'name_mismatch', false, '제이킴스투페이지영어학원', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', NULL, NULL);
