• 이력서 및 자기소개서(자유 양식), 포트폴리오 등', '{PyTorch,Spark,Tensorflow,영상,"영상 판독","머신 비전","로지스틱 회귀"}', '{1468,1474,1477,1970,4511,5058,5762}', false, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/20337/xhsadmzb4tmampub__1080_790.jpg', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/20337/xhsadmzb4tmampub__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/20337/impvgylhxg5wql2l__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/20337/ckzkufargzgiqajv__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/20337/trejhihbr1ma01zm__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '5~15년', NULL, '2026-07-31 00:00:00+09', NULL, '2026-06-16 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-31 01:00:00.87294+09', false, NULL, '대규모 GPU 클러스터 구축(Project Lead)', NULL);
