• 3차 인터뷰는 대표님과의 인터뷰로, 보다 깊이 있는 직무적인 이야기와 컬쳐핏을 확인합니다.
• 채용 프로세스는 유동적으로 조정될 수 있습니다.', '{}', '{}', false, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/jc9l4xwkd8tssqwu__1080_790.jpg', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/jc9l4xwkd8tssqwu__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/cnuhbla6muj7t4md__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/9g93hen3dl4h79vr__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/zj4gj2sjdvkps3qo__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/joufn0fthdfp9wrz__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/ja4myfqzb0ocvwhh__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/onbwn6k8qsjdd5l1__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/sxajetdpaxraegea__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/8/viikup2lnic9vjkn__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '0~10년', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-29 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, '[채널톡] Software Engineer', NULL);
