• 지원서에 허위사실이 있을 경우 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.', '{Python,TypeScript,Notion,Go,Slack}', '{1554,1564,10221,1702,1417}', true, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/15652/jbjk8xn1lp7ewbwl__1080_790.jpg', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/15652/jbjk8xn1lp7ewbwl__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '3~8년', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-26 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, '[웰다] AX Engineer (3~8년)', NULL);
