   * 2차 컬처핏 면접은 최종 합격이 아니며, 연봉 및 근로조건 합의가 된 이후 최종 입사가 확정됩니다.
   * 인성검사는 2차 컬처핏 면접의 참고자료로 1차 직무면접 합격 후 온라인으로 응시하시게 됩니다.(약 40분)
   * 본 채용은 최종 합격 전 평판조회(Reference Check) 전형을 포함할 수 있습니다. 대상자에 한해 별도의 동의를 구한 뒤 진행되며, 평판조회 결과에 따라 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.', '{CSS3,React,JavaScript,TypeScript,HTML5,UX,"웹 표준"}', '{2313,1469,1541,1564,2006,2043,3872}', true, '20만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/ojz0hryow9wz1kjz__1080_790.png', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/ojz0hryow9wz1kjz__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/gup4jhcch82in1ll__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/8dqrsf3kby37yzvx__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/xfiwd94pg9tuxmjm__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/eizvwmhakmtrbbxo__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/obipyod1hsyisa5h__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/ohdzigogmfes63vz__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/kycounvhxxopqmx1__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/u35mwn3c08epnhqz__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/uyundspeh7pwvgte__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/35182/5ygu9kjl5hdwcosd__1080_790.png}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '5~100년', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-26 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, '[계약직][AI Native EHR] Front-End Engineer', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.job_postings (id, source, external_id, source_url, company_id, "position", intro, main_tasks, requirements, preferred_points, benefits, category_parent, category_child, career_min, career_max, is_newbie, is_expert, employment_type, location_country, location_city, location_district, location_full, geo_lat, geo_lng, is_remote, due_time, confirm_time, status, hire_rounds, skill_tags, skill_tag_ids, skills_inferred, reward_total, thumbnail_url, image_urls, raw, collected_at, career_level, categories, deadline_at, editor_note, posted_at, skills, job_category_id, region_id, created_at, updated_at, remote_available, salary_disclosed, title, embedding) VALUES (245, 'wanted', 364411, 'https://www.wanted.co.kr/wd/364411', 205, '프론트엔드 개발자', 'AI 네이티브 시대에 맞는 개발자를 육성하기 위한 교육을 제공합니다.
