• 국가보훈대상자 및 장애인은 관계 법령에 의거하여 우대하고 있습니다.', '{Confluence,JIRA,Python,AWS}', '{1410,1414,1554,1698}', false, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/14284/vdg66gycyalphmve__1080_790.jpg', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/14284/vdg66gycyalphmve__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/14284/e2vowfpfgwjsnbrj__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/14284/ujdsk2fdedn2b5co__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '5~100년', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-29 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, 'Frontend Developer', NULL);
