※ 단순 나열식의 이력서가 아닌, 업무 관련 역량 파악이 가능한 내용으로 제출해주세요.', '{Git,Python,AWS,Docker,PostgreSQL}', '{1411,1554,1698,2217,2683}', false, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10785/xyb93wefrghj3ppy__1080_790.png', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10785/xyb93wefrghj3ppy__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10785/wzy8vgk1g4rri2z0__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10785/j5unkmuorrd70dfh__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10785/tidc3o2lbbyy3iix__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '3~10년', NULL, '2026-06-30 00:00:00+09', NULL, '2026-06-10 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, '프론트엔드 엔지니어', NULL);
