• 당사 모든 모집부문 및 전형에서 국가보훈대상자 및 장애인은 관련 법령(국가유공자 등 예우 및 지원에 관한 법률, 장애인 고용촉진 및 직업재활법)에 의거 가산점을 부여하고 있습니다.', '{Linux,Redis,Java,Python,TCP,REST,Jenkins,RDBMS,"Spring Framework","Spring Boot","Restful API"}', '{1459,1470,1540,1554,1783,1849,2020,2467,3078,10169,10341}', false, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/2529/ug9ht5eiskkvdkpd__1080_790.png', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/2529/ug9ht5eiskkvdkpd__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/2529/n7qdhg3j12c8jajt__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/2529/v0ks11z4myaer26o__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/2529/bp8lcd0k1blabz0q__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/2529/rmnoosnakiptbocu__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/2529/yc2nqa3j8doe7qya__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '5~8년', NULL, '2026-06-30 00:00:00+09', NULL, '2026-06-25 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, '날씨돌 Android 앱 개발', NULL);
