      다만, 처우에 따라 2차 면접이 필요한 경우 사전 안내드립니다.', '{Git,Android,Java,Kotlin,SQL,Swift}', '{1411,1438,1540,1544,1562,1563}', false, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/5742/zvk12wn4r2tuezmq__1080_790.png', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/5742/zvk12wn4r2tuezmq__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/5742/fuqxktfgw7stmi6d__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '5~10년', NULL, '2026-07-02 00:00:00+09', NULL, '2026-04-02 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, '[Remittance] 서버개발자 (경력 5년 이상)', NULL);
