5. 처우 협의 & 입사일 조정

* 전형 절차는 경우에 따라 추가되거나 조정될 수 있습니다.', '{Git,Flask,PyTorch,Tensorflow,Python}', '{1411,1452,1468,1477,1554}', false, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/z05hpl8pc9ujji6n__1080_790.jpg', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/z05hpl8pc9ujji6n__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/qyzuorejaq0puxhm__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/mm86bczg0zvagib6__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/gs0wkx6p5evdxggv__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/crqujl9ijayizb8r__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/ncsu8ptvygo05xkl__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/mbwiv915ldtqqeaa__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/33656/9eoywywcjmhsic5l__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '1~3년', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-21 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, '프론트엔드 개발자 (Junior Frontend Engineer)', '[-0.130323,-0.056014,0.017309,-0.016176,-0.046193,-0.017573,-0.064544,0.037581,-0.064816,0.071516,-0.022995,0.049580,0.042718,0.030511,0.011818,-0.014289,-0.021337,0.012892,0.078914,0.009664,-0.055039,-0.046165,0.077835,-0.049414,-0.035944,0.011457,0.015125,0.029226,0.059183,-0.117120,0.075699,0.026616,0.000350,-0.005053,-0.023364,0.124984,-0.090946,-0.031649,-0.077286,0.028748,-0.028100,0.061814,0.058351,0.026461,0.001566,-0.047238,0.013503,-0.055566,-0.071359,-0.043567,-0.087103,-0.085298,-0.010070,-0.087141,-0.007550,0.048336,0.060599,-0.019317,-0.046370,-0.056296,0.023857,0.012399,-0.065175,-0.000533,-0.049117,0.080591,-0.017590,0.028563,0.170783,-0.065037,-0.095443,0.030331,-0.093618,0.032228,-0.017617,0.001086,0.026409,0.058618,0.076461,-0.097310,0.019051,-0.014621,0.081390,-0.002617,0.074119,0.008561,-0.001501,0.089091,-0.075855,0.042467,0.072039,-0.000507,0.003397,0.044422,0.008407,0.017922,0.028934