• 2차 면접의 경우 상황에 따라 당일에 추가 진행 될 수 있습니다.
• 해외여행에 결격사유가 있을 시 채용이 취소됩니다.
• 입사 후 3개월의 수습 기간이 있으며, 수습 기간 동안 급여는 100% 지급됩니다.', '{React,SVG,Redux}', '{1469,6736,10284}', true, '100만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/6087/wmkex0nzpdui1wjp__1080_790.jpg', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/6087/wmkex0nzpdui1wjp__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/6087/zko8o0trqyg2ow5i__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/6087/3ze3iimxc5clgnum__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/6087/uslhbuxvd9ldiocn__1080_790.jpg,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/6087/37reqtcaf0zgavtv__1080_790.jpg}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '5~11년', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, 'Front-end SWE', '[-0.092022,-0.033627,-0.035627,-0.004641,-0.008816,-0.011872,-0.112336,0.018640,-0.035588,0.045542,-0.052395,0.037938,0.071919,-0.016270,0.039530,-0.068000,0.025156,0.004858,0.064263,0.038973,-0.111894,-0.105869,0.028767,-0.067217,-0.083064,0.009103,-0.002486,0.020614,-0.084457,-0.150485,0.126190,0.067002,0.001172,-0.034803,-0.041474,0.009374,0.013446,-0.009361,-0.183176,0.016009,-0.057296,0.081168,-0.001621,0.016432,0.047067,-0.022397,-0.052466,-0.068880,-0.045269,0.024911,-0.054811,-0.028282,-0.072901,0.060503,0.025549,0.044100,0.050408,0.002080,-0.083683,-0.001970,0.057523,-0.017262,-0.024776,0.050742,0.052449,0.044617,0.041762,0.022153,0.014838,-0.081298,-0.102075,-0.023788,-0.027018,-0.036749,0.016374,0.005227,-0.016421,-0.008933,0.122057,-0.070635,0.019834,0.045369,-0.060406,0.026953,0.080688,0.063467,-0.069349,0.048492,-0.065200,-0.030321,0.069282,0.034721,0.044666,-0.032842,0.008627,0.009938,-0.023842,-0.037495,0.019964,0.108585,-0.010008,-0.028638,0.022330,-0.040321,-0.006014,-0.001037,0.085459,0.039882,-0.037593,0.006852,-0.040727,0.043144,-0.055089,-0.012116,0.014262,0.046939,-0.041689,-0.007540,-0.008270,0.018772,0.054728,-0.020734,0.029752,-0.021496,0.141053,-0.015753,-0.