• Provide AWS technical guidance and evangelize use of AWS with customers
• Enable customers to use best practices and design their applications and platforms for the cloud
• Dive deep and wide within the AWS platform to delight customers', '• Bachelor''s degree or above in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or related fields
• Expected to graduate by August 2026, or graduated within the past 24 months
• Experience with two or more of the following: networking fundamentals, security, storage or databases (relational or NoSQL), operating systems (Unix, Linux, and/or Windows)
• Experience with one of the following programming languages: Java, Python, Ruby, Node.js, C#, C++, or other modern computing languages', '• Experience implementing a cloud-based technology solution in a school project or while working for a company
• Experience with one or more of the following domains: Big Data, Analytics, Security, DevOps, Application Development, or Machine Learning
• Awareness of AWS or cloud computing', '자세한 사항은 홈페이지 참조', '개발', '{"DevOps / 시스템 관리자","서버 개발자","소프트웨어 엔지니어"}', NULL, 100, false, true, 'regular', '한국', '서울', '강남구', '서울특별시 강남구 테헤란로 231 (역삼동, 센터필드 서관 12층)', 37.5030426, 127.041588, false, NULL, '2026-05-18 00:00:00+09', 'ACTIVE', '', '{Linux,Java,Python,AWS,Node.js,NoSQL,C++,C#,UNIX,DevOps,"Machine Learning"}', '{1459,1540,1554,1698,1547,2121,1786,1533,1808,1952,1595}', true, '50만원', 'https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/56940/edysu2unsddfbodt__1080_790.png', '{https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/56940/edysu2unsddfbodt__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/56940/ahvpyffpurjfg3te__1080_790.png,https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/56940/vzi7gfzbtw3gwgac__1080_790.png}', NULL, '2026-07-29 14:38:58.734046+09', '경력무관', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-18 00:00:00+09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', '2026-07-30 22:52:23.175012+09', false, NULL, 'Associate Solutions Architect', '[-0.041100,-0.053154,0.001659,-0.018544,-0.079498,-0.017300,-0.069355,0.007133,-0.020582,0.084825,-0.013136,-0.001477,0.055020,-0.001985,0.035810,-0.050461,-0.027559,-0.008311,0.036805,-0.028473,-0.102245,-0.044856,-0.030890,-0.037610,-0.054747,-0.004729,0.049612,0.043059,0.017844,-0.060484,0.032481,0.003278,0.039186,-0.026012,0.007629,0.110845,-0.011807,-0.052543,-0.123227,0.010923,-0.009566,-0.023614,0.042751,-0.000485,0.009030,-0.008338,-0.002079,0.000207,-0.126083,-0.081410,-0.020076,-0.032036,0.028877,-0.055326,-0.049373,0.028439,0.043930,0.049953,-0.113963,-0.049482,0.065997,-0.023726,-0.020066,0.006205,0.022093,0.058205,0.074304,0.033946,0.022638,-0.085636,-0.091456,-0.043874,-0.082810,0.007316,0.031295,0.008667,0.076979,-0.019518,0.071213,-0.019796,-0.001712,0.026674,0.015709,0.082088,-0.026340,0.023712,-0.026692,0.009928,0.015540,0.028914,-0.053662,-0.021242,-0.000975,-0.048810,-0.005207,0.011557,0.027182,0.015271,-0.013609,0.128698,-0.093044,0.034482,-0.019904,-0.075676,0.030560,0.031028,0